{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1085508-on-the-affable-aid-affinity","id":1085508,"title":"On the \"Affable Aid\" Affinity","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-29T10:59:04-07:00","id":1085508,"title":"On the \"Affable Aid\" Affinity","content":"One thing I've just noticed about 'Affable Aid' and a few other Affinities: They have a benefit that adds +2 to select rolls, but by paying 1 Willpower the bonus can equal their defining Pillar rating instead, for one roll. Now at most, a Pillar rating can reach 5, making the roll bonus +5...which is exactly what the bonus would be if you spent 1 Willpower for the standard +3 bonus. As such, I have to ask, what is the benefit to the Willpower expenditure aspect of these Affinities?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T15:26:24-07:00","id":1085605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1085508-on-the-affable-aid-affinity#post1085508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing I've just noticed about 'Affable Aid' and a few other Affinities: They have a benefit that adds +2 to select rolls, but by paying 1 Willpower the bonus can equal their defining Pillar rating instead, for one roll. Now at most, a Pillar rating can reach 5, making the roll bonus +5...which is exactly what the bonus would be if you spent 1 Willpower for the standard +3 bonus. As such, I have to ask, what is the benefit to the Willpower expenditure aspect of these Affinities?</div> </div> </div> </div>My group ended up ruling that those Affinities grant you 2+Pillar Rating when you spend Willpower instead. It doesn't make a whole lot of sense otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T18:12:07-07:00","id":1085635,"title":"","content":"Hmm. A workable fix, but even then it only helps if the Pillar rating is at least 4.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T06:25:41-07:00","id":1085770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1085508-on-the-affable-aid-affinity?p=1085635#post1085635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. A workable fix, but even then it only helps if the Pillar rating is at least 4.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's not a whole lot that can be done with the wording as is. It's a bit weird.<br /> <br /> The only other solution I can think of is that it should add 2+Pillar Rating <i>on top of</i> the passive +2 from the Affinity. At which point it's worth it the moment you have a Pillar at 2. And also means a single point of Willpower can add 7 dice at Pillar 5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1059,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","user":"Azahul","date":". 04-30-2017, 09:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}